      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">When to do what — 8 weeks to departure</h3>
      <div class="timeline-steps">
        <div class="t-step">
          <div class="t-step-marker"><span>8</span></div>
          <div class="t-step-body">
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">8 weeks before</strong>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Start Tibet Travel Permit application through a registered agency. Book international flights to China.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-step">
          <div class="t-step-marker"><span>6</span></div>
          <div class="t-step-body">
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">6 weeks before</strong>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Apply for Chinese tourist visa (L visa). Book Lhasa hotel with oxygen system for first 2 nights.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-step">
          <div class="t-step-marker"><span>4</span></div>
          <div class="t-step-body">
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">4 weeks before</strong>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Reserve Potala Palace tickets through your tour operator. Book flights or train to Lhasa. Consult doctor about altitude medication.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-step">
          <div class="t-step-marker"><span>2</span></div>
          <div class="t-step-body">
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">2 weeks before</strong>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Confirm all bookings. Pack using our checklist. Download offline maps and translation apps. Print all permits and tickets.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-step">
          <div class="t-step-marker"><span>0</span></div>
          <div class="t-step-body">
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Arrival day</strong>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Rest and hydrate. No strenuous activity. Gentle walk on Barkhor Street. <a href="/visit" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] font-medium hover:underline">Read the full visit guide</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


{/* TICKET COST CALCULATOR */}
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-8 px-6">
    <div class="cost-calc-card">
