{/* 5. WHY VISIT — 3 image cards */}  <section class="section">
<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
<div class="section-header text-center">
<span class="section-tag">
Why Potala</span>
<h2 class="section-title">
Not just a palace. A world unto itself.</h2>
<p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto">
Three reasons this place stays with you long after you descend the Red Hill.</p>
</div>
<div class="why-grid">
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-card-media">
<img src="/images/gallery-potala-chakpori-hill.webp" alt="Panoramic view of Potala Palace from Chakpori Hill" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
</div>
<div class="why-card-body">
<h3 class="why-card-title">
The View That Rewires You</h3>
<p>
3,700 meters on the Red Hill, Lhasa valley spreading below, Himalayan foothills on the horizon. Golden roofs catching afternoon sun, prayer flags snapping in thin air. You forget your phone exists.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-card-media">
<img src="/images/gallery-potala-golden-roofs.webp" alt="Potala Palace golden roofs glowing at sunset" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
</div>
<div class="why-card-body">
<h3 class="why-card-title">
Architecture That Defies Belief</h3>
<p>
Thirteen stories, 1,000+ rooms, walls 3 meters thick at the base. Built at the elevation where airplanes pressurize their cabins -- without cranes, without steel frames. Modern architects still study how it stands.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="why-card">
<div class="why-card-media">
<img src="/images/gallery-potala-murals.webp" alt="Ancient Buddhist murals inside Potala Palace" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
</div>
<div class="why-card-body">
<h3 class="why-card-title">
A Living Museum of Tibetan Buddhism</h3>
<p>
200,000 Buddhist statues, priceless thangkas, sutras handwritten in gold ink, gilded stupa tombs of eight Dalai Lamas. Monks still chant here. Butter lamps still burn. Incense hangs in corridors walked for 13 centuries.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
