  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 mt-6">
    <div class="visit-preview-card">
      <div class="visit-preview-badge">Don't Miss</div>
      <h3 class="visit-preview-title">What to Expect on Visit Day</h3>
      <p class="visit-preview-text">The east gate opens at 9:30 AM. The climb to the entrance takes 20-30 minutes uphill. The route is one-way through the White Palace into the Red Palace. Golden roofs at the top. Exit on the west side. Most visitors spend 2-3 hours inside. <a href="/visit" class="font-medium" style="color:white;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Read the complete step-by-step guide</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>


