<p>
Inside: the White Palace (living quarters, ceremonial halls, silk thangkas), then the Red Palace (golden stupa tombs of the Dalai Lamas, ancient murals, the 7th-century Dharma Cave). You exit two to three hours later, blinking in the sunlight, processing what you just saw.</p>
